SharesMintHandlerTest
├── When setting the pre-mint hook
│   ├── When the hook setter is not the admin or owner
│   │   └── It should revert with {ComponentHelpersMixin__OnlyAdminOrOwner__Unauthorized}.
│   └── When the hook setter is the admin or owner
│       ├── It should store the pre-mint hook.
│       └── It should emit {PreMintHookSet}.
└── When minting shares
    ├── When the mint caller is not the admin or owner
    │   └── It should revert with {ComponentHelpersMixin__OnlyAdminOrOwner__Unauthorized}.
    └── When the mint caller is the admin or owner
        ├── Given the handler is not registered as a deposit handler
        │   └── It should revert with {Shares__OnlyDepositHandler__Unauthorized}.
        └── Given the handler is registered as a deposit handler
            ├── When any input has a zero shares amount
            │   └── It should revert with {SharesMintHandler__Mint__ZeroShares}.
            └── When all inputs have a non-zero shares amount
                ├── Given no pre-mint hook is set
                │   ├── It should mint the shares amount to each recipient.
                │   └── It should emit {SharesMinted} per input.
                └── Given a pre-mint hook is set
                    ├── It should call the pre-mint hook per input with the caller, recipient, and shares amount.
                    ├── It should mint the shares amount to each recipient.
                    └── It should emit {SharesMinted} per input.
